00:26:43.870 --> 00:26:47.470
Those top visualizations
come out of that model.

00:26:47.470 --> 00:26:49.010
They come out of BigQuery.

00:26:49.010 --> 00:26:51.700
All we can get--
seven, 10, 30 days,

00:26:51.700 --> 00:26:53.350
two years with a
data out of there,

00:26:53.350 --> 00:26:55.150
come through that API layer.

00:26:55.150 --> 00:26:58.140
The cool part about that too is,
I may have different business

00:26:58.140 --> 00:26:58.640
