00:27:03.790 --> 00:27:06.920
People don't want a report,
don't want things like that.

00:27:06.920 --> 00:27:08.690
Other people just
want an API, and they

00:27:08.690 --> 00:27:09.940
want us to give them the data.

00:27:09.940 --> 00:27:13.540
If I want to settle and I'm a
developer, I want to get that.

00:27:13.540 --> 00:27:16.000
So when they log
into the portal,

00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:17.530
they'll see their data here.

00:27:17.530 --> 00:27:21.208
If they have their developer
develop against our API book

00:27:21.208 --> 00:27:22.750
that we're putting
out there, they're

00:27:22.750 --> 00:27:24.040
going to get the same data.

00:27:24.040 --> 00:27:26.710
If I ship this visualization
off to another portal

00:27:26.710 --> 00:27:29.410
