their portal and display it,

00:27:29.410 --> 00:27:30.820
it is the same data.

00:27:30.820 --> 00:27:34.180
Because BigQuery and that
architecture that JD has shown

00:27:34.180 --> 00:27:36.710
you allow you to do that.

00:27:36.710 --> 00:27:38.590
The reason I showed you
the demo earlier is,

00:27:38.590 --> 00:27:40.270
we're starting to roll this.

00:27:40.270 --> 00:27:42.940
This portal is reality
