how many people build systems

00:27:50.860 --> 00:27:53.600
where you built a report, and
that guy needs this column,

00:27:53.600 --> 00:27:55.230
the other guy needs
a different column,

00:27:55.230 --> 00:27:58.450
and all of a sudden you end
up with just a ton of reports.

00:27:58.450 --> 00:28:01.900
Because BigQuery allows us
to put all those columns out

00:28:01.900 --> 00:28:04.840
