API from BigQuery.

00:28:20.950 --> 00:28:24.250
We've built a custom
report tab down here.

00:28:24.250 --> 00:28:26.830
And this, I think, is part
of a pretty cool design.

00:28:26.830 --> 00:28:29.050
Some of our partners and
some of our design team

00:28:29.050 --> 00:28:31.420
came up with some of this.

00:28:31.420 --> 00:28:34.210
Those columns down there,
those come from the same API.

00:28:34.210 --> 00:28:35.660
They've been delivered.

00:28:35.660 --> 00:28:37.540
And that what you can do is--

00:28:37.540 --> 00:28:40.540
I talked about before, we
have to service everybody

00:28:40.540 --> 00:28:43.360
from the small mom and
pop to the big guy.

00:28:43.360 --> 00:28:45.790
This little custom
report thing here

00:28:45.790 --> 00:28:48.550
is kind of what I would call
the iPhone of reporting.

00:28:48.550 --> 00:28:53.250
It allows you to take on,
and remove, add, sort,

00:28:53.250 --> 00:28:55.400
