on that report.

00:28:55.400 --> 00:28:57.910
So when we hit that API
and get all the data,

00:28:57.910 --> 00:28:59.120
we're grabbing all the data.

00:28:59.120 --> 00:28:59.830
It's there.

00:28:59.830 --> 00:29:01.340
It's instantaneous.

00:29:01.340 --> 00:29:07.510
So I can put and remove things
from this portal as we go.

00:29:07.510 --> 00:29:11.770
And that way, I don't have to
make 200 versions of a report.

00:29:11.770 --> 00:29:13.300
It's all sitting
there, all coming

00:29:13.300 --> 00:29:16.030
